      "unit": "%",
      "description": "EMS11 TQI_ACOR (actual indicated engine torque after correction) from CAN 0x316 D1, raw*0.390625 %. Combined with TQFR to derive net crank torque. Dyno-validated 2026-08-02 (tuned 2021 VN MT, Dynocom): model peak 313 lb-ft vs 312.0 wheel lb-ft measured; hp within ~4%. Byte-identical to EMS16 0x260 D1 (mean diff 0.25 raw on the same capture)."
