      "maxValue": 99.61,
      "unit": "%",
      "description": "EMS11 TQFR (friction/pumping torque) from CAN 0x316 D5, raw*0.390625 %. Net torque % = TQI_ACOR - TQFR. Veloster N validated."
    },
